.git/
.gitignore
.remember/
# Anchored to the repo root on purpose. A bare `data/` matches a directory of
# that name at ANY depth, which silently dropped api/app/core/data/countries.json
# from the build context: the file was committed, present locally, and absent in
# Cloud Build, where every discovery test failed on FileNotFoundError.
/data/
/plan/
web/node_modules/
web/.next/
api/.venv/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
